 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Change an appointment",
   "texto": [
    "**Avtale** can mean «date» or «agreement», depending on the context. **Flytte avtalen** is to change it from date to time; **utsette** is to postpone it and **avlyse**, to cancel it.",
    "To ask what time it is appropriate: **Hvilket tidspunkt passer deg?** **hvilket** is used because **tidspunkt** is neutral (**et tidspunkt**)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Simple conditions",
   "texto": [
    "A sentence with **hvis** («si») has a condition: **Hvis jeg kommer senere, sender jeg en melding** («If I get there later, I'll send you a message.»). If the condition goes first, the verb of the main prayer remains second: **sender jeg**."
   ]
  },
